    In the body. Note the damage disagrees with the Power Armor Commando''s own
    list on printed 164, which prints 5D6 M.D. for the same item; both readings
    are recorded and neither is stored, since there is no row to store them on.
  - The standard cybernetics - gyro-compass, clock calendar, universal headjack
    and ear with amplified hearing and a toxic filter - are cybernetics rather
    than carried gear. In the body, with the eighth-level additions.
  - starting_money is the first-level savings the book prints, 2D4x1000. The
    2500 credit monthly salary and the 4500 to 8000 a month for 8th level and
    higher are pay rather than starting coin and are in the body. Note this
    entry''s rank threshold is EIGHTH level, not the ninth the Army O.C.C.s use.
  - Skill bases are catalog base plus the printed bonus, already added.
